  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC. Measurement of the identical charged kaon one-dimensional femtoscopy in p-Pb collisions at a center-of-mass energy per nucleon pair of 5.02 TeV by the ALICE experiment. Femtoscopic radii are obtained in as a function of three multiplicity event classes and two pair transverse momentum ranges. The measured p-Pb radii are equal to those observed in pp collisions.\n",
